{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/41876cb1f60a9dfc25e8c70e4a0ddd46.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a roguelike management sim where your career as a racing bunny stable manager may be as fast and short as a bunny's quick lifespan. Reach the Diamond Dutch Ultimatum Race before you accumulate three losses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/7c0722440330055b489838d6690baeb4.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique Natures that impact racing and feeding strategy, each bunny you buy as an egg and hatch will contribute to your roster in a unique way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/fc138543a9f4d88583cb85079b8169e8.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a brief period of time before your bunnies are too old to race and retire, you have to budget carefully for different types of food that will raise one of a bunny's three stats. Do you focus on stamina so they can sprint for longer, or go all in on speed - or do you give them more chutzpah, allowing for a bigger boost to their speed when they sprint? Will you go for a balanced approach, or a targeted one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/1adc3025a0f9c56ed754c7f9617f3630.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/1adc3025a0f9c56ed754c7f9617f3630.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/94ed7e3e814bf99e1845828d49c90a24.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to direct your bunny's energy once they hit the track, knowing when to sprint, when to reserve their stamina, and when to go for broke and risk using all their stamina knowing that they'll pass out shortly after you empty their stamina bar!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/36c63c4eabd1aa5580721b7b38608952.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your bunnies are old enough, breed them together to combine their stats resulting in super-speedy multicolored offspring. Watch your bunnies' lineage grow and become more and more colorful as you add more bunnies (and their juicy stats!) to the bloodline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/3806ec7370fa46075028a43143e32d4e.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings with it a new random rare item in the shop that you could buy. Will you be conservative with your money to make sure you have a steady budget for food, or gamble it on a rare egg or an expansion to your stables?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4d51366c3b64db17576fed9372288eff.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more Stable Managers to play as, deploying their unique abilities to help your bunnies, by winning at higher and higher difficulties with different managers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/1adc3025a0f9c56ed754c7f9617f3630.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/1adc3025a0f9c56ed754c7f9617f3630.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4ef181a42e53ec378011cf7c78f3877e.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a team of unstoppable racers by paying close attention to their Natures and how they synergize with your Stable Manager ability, strategizing the best way to get as fast as possible as quickly as possible!\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Copper Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/d5565e26bfd9106ac49613cd75c07f09c05ec25a.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/7ef0383894a43663f66ee295cc4ed4cf56d94b21.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/0b650749d0a6d85cfa70b5f413c4e2c280827122.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/a18cb52c322c53ac3450304e3c1193f8999c7605.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/03b766dc764966b1124e38c4737ba459f7a1adb6.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/4f36a94525166aaef55cfd7bd94d5d919f8b7b80.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Bunny Banker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/076f2cd0453d553a52255d8d40ca08ce02b6a1d7.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Bunny Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/4f43bc0453fa16c744d97b2c7f1737baaf6a550d.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Bunny Carpenter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/a7041eeb09bd233962e01752a8663b2fbb497a93.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Bunny Disciplinarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943850/9b11664f8dab48404711e51b8e5c6aa05a1bb23e.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943850?t=1765306455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/05dbd27ade51246402890b2374c30ba5032b6dad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765306455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/405b1d28d29cdfe02fd552f66ae2448fb311287f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765306455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/405b1d28d29cdfe02fd552f66ae2448fb311287f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765306455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4237460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/41876cb1f60a9dfc25e8c70e4a0ddd46.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a roguelike management sim where your career as a racing bunny stable manager may be as fast and short as a bunny's quick lifespan. Reach the Diamond Dutch Ultimatum Race before you accumulate three losses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/7c0722440330055b489838d6690baeb4.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique Natures that impact racing and feeding strategy, each bunny you buy as an egg and hatch will contribute to your roster in a unique way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/fc138543a9f4d88583cb85079b8169e8.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a brief period of time before your bunnies are too old to race and retire, you have to budget carefully for different types of food that will raise one of a bunny's three stats. Do you focus on stamina so they can sprint for longer, or go all in on speed - or do you give them more chutzpah, allowing for a bigger boost to their speed when they sprint? Will you go for a balanced approach, or a targeted one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/1adc3025a0f9c56ed754c7f9617f3630.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/1adc3025a0f9c56ed754c7f9617f3630.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/94ed7e3e814bf99e1845828d49c90a24.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to direct your bunny's energy once they hit the track, knowing when to sprint, when to reserve their stamina, and when to go for broke and risk using all their stamina knowing that they'll pass out shortly after you empty their stamina bar!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/202121fea44da902632cc0407beae330.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/36c63c4eabd1aa5580721b7b38608952.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your bunnies are old enough, breed them together to combine their stats resulting in super-speedy multicolored offspring. Watch your bunnies' lineage grow and become more and more colorful as you add more bunnies (and their juicy stats!) to the bloodline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/18da3f6ba2105a81b1bde75a8ca8834a.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/3806ec7370fa46075028a43143e32d4e.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings with it a new random rare item in the shop that you could buy. Will you be conservative with your money to make sure you have a steady budget for food, or gamble it on a rare egg or an expansion to your stables?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.apng?t=1765306455\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4335b97dfd3c3357578b1c3052e02f9f.poster.avif?t=1765306455\" class=\"bb_img\" width=666 height=102 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943850/extras/4d51366c3b64db17576fed9372288eff.avif?t=1765306455\" width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more Stable Managers to play as, deploying their unique abilities to help your bunnies, by 